OL,3,ADeath of Cindy Crawford's son Presley
OL,4,AGerber being investigated as suspected
OL,5,Aoverdose
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficials are investigating the death
OL,8,Fof Presley Gerber, the son of
OL,9,Fsupermodel Cindy Crawford, as a
OL,10,Fsuspected overdose, Santa Monica police
OL,11,Fsaid on Monday.
OL,13,FThe 27-year-old model died at a rehab
OL,14,Ffacility on Sunday, according to Los
OL,15,FAngeles County Medical Examiner
OL,16,Frecords. The exact cause of death has
OL,17,Fnot been determined, police said,
OL,18,Fadding there was no indication of foul
OL,19,Fplay.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
