OL,3,ADeath of Cindy Crawford's son Presley
OL,4,AGerber being investigated as suspected
OL,5,Aoverdose
OL,6,
OL,7,FAllie Jenkins, a representative for
OL,8,FCrawford and her husband Rande Gerber,
OL,9,Ftold the BBC's US partner CBS News:
OL,10,F"The family is asking for privacy
OL,11,Fduring this very difficult and painful
OL,12,Ftime."
OL,14,FGerber had been a model like his mother
OL,15,Fand younger sister Kaia, making his
OL,16,Fcatwalk debut for Italian label
OL,17,FMoschino aged just 16.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
